[TEXT] **Critical finding!** The dswa1 FORWARD chain has TWO rules:
1. `iifname "br0.10" meta l4proto icmp ip saddr 10.1.0.0/24 ip daddr 10.3.0.0/24 counter packets 6 bytes 504 accept` — ICMP from A→B **accepted** (6 hits = the Phase 1 ping tests)
